% The customs background (lpsPlus docs/strategy/FactsBackground.md §6.1):
% the customs presumptions. What is taken to be so when a text is silent,
% each rule citing the text that says it: US Customs' publication on apparel
% terminology, and rulings. A derived fact says "according to customs
% presumptions"; the strict reading leaves it out (language reference §14.5,
% §17.5). A stated fact beats a presumed one.
%
% Used only to read facts from a text (language reference §14.5).

the target language is: prolog.

the functions are:
    the fabric construction of *a garment* is *a construction*.

the templates are:
    the field *a field* of *a thing* reads *a value*; undefined.
    *a thing* is made of the fabric *a name*; undefined.
    the kind of *a good* is *a kind*; undefined.
    *a kind* is a kind of knitted garments.
    *a garment* has its construction from a field.
    the fabric of *a garment* is lightweight.
    *a garment* is of plain knit fabric.
    the fabric construction of *a garment* is *a construction*.

the knowledge base customs presumptions includes:

the apparel terminology publication is published at "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/rulings/informed-compliance-publications".
the text of the apparel terminology publication is at "../sources/cbp_icp/apparel_terminology.txt".
ruling NY N361819 is published at "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/N361819".
the text of ruling NY N361819 is at "../sources/cbp/N361819.txt".

T-shirt is a kind of knitted garments,
    as stated in the apparel terminology publication, confer "T-shirts (6109, 6111) - are underwear style garments, constructed from lightweight, plain jersey or interlock knit fabric".
sweater is a kind of knitted garments,
    as stated in the apparel terminology publication, confer "Sweaters (6110, 6111) - are knit garments".
pullover is a kind of knitted garments,
    as stated in the apparel terminology publication, confer "Pullovers (6110, 6111) - are upper body knit garments".
bodysuit is a kind of knitted garments,
    as stated in the apparel terminology publication, confer "Bodysuits and bodyshirts (6114) - are knit one-piece garments".

rule tshirt_fabric with provenance the apparel terminology publication,
        confer "T-shirts (6109, 6111) - are underwear style garments, constructed from lightweight, plain jersey or interlock knit fabric":
the fabric of a garment is lightweight
    if the kind of the garment is T-shirt.

rule tshirt_plain_knit with provenance the apparel terminology publication,
        confer "constructed from lightweight, plain jersey or interlock knit fabric":
a garment is of plain knit fabric
    if the kind of the garment is T-shirt.

% A listing's field on how the fabric is made comes first (the marketplace
% listings background reads it); the kind presumes only when it is silent.
rule construction_field_first with provenance the apparel terminology publication,
        confer "Apparel Terminology under the HTSUS":
a garment has its construction from a field
    if the field "craft of weaving" of the garment reads a value.

rule knitted_by_kind with provenance the apparel terminology publication,
        confer "are knit garments":
the fabric construction of a garment is knitted
    if the kind of the garment is a kind
    and the kind is a kind of knitted garments
    and it is not the case that
        the garment has its construction from a field.

rule fleece_knitted with provenance ruling NY N361819,
        confer "polyester knit fleece fabric":
the fabric construction of a garment is knitted
    if the garment is made of the fabric "fleece"
    and it is not the case that
        the garment has its construction from a field.

scenario tee is:
    the kind of tee is T-shirt.
    the kind of jumper is sweater.
    the field "craft of weaving" of jumper reads "tat".
    fabrics expects answers ["the fabric of tee is lightweight"].
    constructions expects answers ["the fabric construction of tee is knitted"].
    plain expects answers ["tee is of plain knit fabric"].

query fabrics is:
    the fabric of which garment is lightweight.

query constructions is:
    the fabric construction of which garment is which construction.

query plain is:
    which garment is of plain knit fabric.
